{"version":1,"content":"<p>《魔盜王》63歲男星尊尼狄普（Johnny Depp）最近忙於宣傳新片《衰鬼聖誕頌》（Ebenezer），日前接受美媒《Entertainment Tonight》訪問，提到事隔10年再拍《魔盜王》的可能性？</p><p>他開出一個條件：「只要是謝利畢咸瑪（Jerry Bruckheimer）擔任監製，無論什麼電影，我明日就可以開工。</p><p>我相信他，因為我們友誼深厚。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.782519+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:58:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:32.278671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.351660+00:00","content_hash":"fbf0ed2e885d2f72e4aa85741ca1021743c117546e7c079aa0f21a615bb99624","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}